    narr:variation [ narr:text "The broader narrative cites an incident-driven origin for the gate, but the four operational expressions present it as a flat in-force decision with no reference to any past failure — the origin story lives only at the narrative layer." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedManifestGateAsInForceControl> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
